      "text": "TH-73 HITU\nNAS WHITING FIELD, FL\nCDR KEVIN MEIER Capt EDWARD STARKE\nOFFICER IN CHARGE LT CHRIS MARQUIS OPERATIONS OFFICER\nSafety Officer Review\nMonday, 23-Nov-2026\nSUNRISE: 0621 MOONRISE: 1551 % ILLUM: 97% JULIAN DATE: 6327\nSUNSET: 1648 MOONSET: 0515\nTOTAL FLY EVENTS: 13 TOTAL FLY HRS: 24.5 SYL FLY EVENTS: 12 SYL FLY HRS: 23.5\nTOTAL SIM EVENTS: 4 TOTAL SIM HRS: 6.0 SYL SIM EVENTS: 4 SYL SIM HRS: 6.0\nDUTY/WATCH ASSIGNED SIGN IN SIGN OUT\nAM FDO ENS GOLDBLOOM Y 0500 1300\nPM FDO ENS BOYDEN J 1300 2300\nComments:\n***ALL IUTs, PLEASE INPUT HOLIDAY LEAVE INTO T-SHARP ASAP.\n***ALL IUTs ARE ELIGIBLE TO STAND SUNDAY CLOSED TOWER OPS DUTY OFFICER FOR FCF FLIGHTS. SNIV IF\nUNAVAILABLE.\n***All P.I.C.\u2019s download the Airman safety App to complete ASAP reports.\nhttps://asap.safety.af.mil/#/\n***HITU Exit Survey: https://cnatra.gov1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV0SQD2qSoDr88Bgi"
